855     {\cf20 //  - CloseCurrentPopup(): use inside the BeginPopup()/EndPopup() scope to close manually.}\par
856     {\cf20 //  - CloseCurrentPopup() is called by default by Selectable()/MenuItem() when activated (FIXME: need some options).}\par
857     {\cf20 //  - Use ImGuiPopupFlags_NoOpenOverExistingPopup to avoid opening a popup if there's already one at the same level. This is equivalent to e.g. testing for !IsAnyPopupOpen() prior to OpenPopup().}\par
858     {\cf20 //  - Use IsWindowAppearing() after BeginPopup() to tell if a window just opened.}\par
