870     {\cf20 //    - After: The default = 0 means ImGuiPopupFlags_MouseButtonRight. Explicitly passing a literal 1 also means ImGuiPopupFlags_MouseButtonRight (if legacy behavior are enabled) or will assert (if legacy behavior are disabled).}\par
