3048 {\cf20 // This mainly contains a list of selection requests.}\par
3049 {\cf20 // - Use 'Demo->Tools->Debug Log->Selection' to see requests as they happen.}\par
3050 {\cf20 // - Some fields are only useful if your list is dynamic and allows deletion (getting post-deletion focus/state right is shown in the demo)}\par
