3160 {\cf20 // Special Draw callback value to request renderer backend to reset the graphics/render state.}\par
3161 {\cf20 // The renderer backend needs to handle this special value, otherwise it will crash trying to call a function at this address.}\par
3162 {\cf20 // This is useful, for example, if you submitted callbacks which you know have altered the render state and you want it to be restored.}\par
