3185     {\cf20 // Since 1.83: returns ImTextureID associated with this draw call. Warning: DO NOT assume this is always same as 'TextureId' (we will change this function for an upcoming feature)}\par
3186     {\cf20 // Since 1.92: removed ImDrawCmd::TextureId field, the getter function must be used!}\par
